# Documentation Guidelines

Only create docs with lasting value — avoid doc debt. Full reference: `docs/agent-guides/DOCUMENTATION_GUIDELINES.md`.

## Never create

- Docs in the project root — use the appropriate `docs/` subfolder
- Status docs ("COMPLETE", "SUCCESS", "FIXED") — use git commits instead
- Dated filenames — use descriptive names

## Placement

| Topic | Location |
|-------|----------|
| Architecture | `docs/architecture/` |
| Features | `docs/features/[feature-name]/` |
| Database | `docs/database/` or `supabase/` |
| VIVA | `docs/viva/` |
| Design system | `docs/design-system/` |
| Technical decisions | `docs/technical/` |

## Required header

```markdown
# Document Title

**Last Updated:** Month Day, Year
**Status:** Active | Archived | Deprecated
```

## Auto-generated docs

`docs/generated/` is produced by `npm run docs:schema`, `docs:api`, `docs:constants` — never edit manually.
